  "title": "Opor Ayam (Chicken in Coconut Milk)",
  "description": "The kitchen will smell amazing this Ramadan when you make this Indonesian recipe for chicken stewed in coconut milk with lemongrass, ginger, galangal, and lime leaves.",
  "authors": [
    "GrowinKitchen"
  ],
